OL,3,GNEWSACouncil speaker charged with
OL,4,Athreats to kill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe speaker of Bedford Borough Council
OL,7,Fhas been charged with making threats to
OL,8,Fkill and possession of an offensive
OL,9,Fweapon.
OL,11,FTim Caswell was arrested by armed
OL,12,Fofficers after Bedfordshire Police was
OL,13,Fcalled to Crispin Drive shortly before
OL,14,F19:15 BST on Friday over concerns for
OL,15,Fwelfare.
OL,17,FThe 66-year-old, who lives on the
OL,18,Fstreet, has also been charged with
OL,19,Fmaking threats to damage or destroy
OL,20,Fproperty.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
